his is a larger multi-component setup; cloning the Lua game repository alone does not produce the complete playable game.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Install a complete free release before isolating a module-level development task.","Pin the engine, game version, map and local AI configuration.","Use a small custom scenario and a fixed time budget rather than an uncontrolled online match.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Reach a construction or economy target from a fixed map and starting position.","Evaluate unit selection, pathing and tactical resource use against a fixed local opponent.","Modify a small Lua unit or game rule and verify the scenario and saved/replayed behavior.","AI 使用与评估条件","Useful for code instrumentation and RTS planning, but preserve module and asset provenance. A public game-module repository does not establish a single license for the complete installed game.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98,99],"evidence",{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"Official project and development entry","https://zero-k.info/","Steam release","https://store.steampowered.com/app/334920/ZeroK/","Pinned game-module GPLv2 license","https://github.com/ZeroK-RTS/Zero-K/blob/e358dac2ca2f9163c5290f700d74466016305b04/LICENSE","Game modules and source notices","https://github.com/ZeroK-RTS/Zero-K","查看许可条款",[111],"licenseUrl",{"_58":108,"_25":107},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Mixed licenses across models, textures, sound and maps; the game-logic repository is not a blanket asset license.","assetLicense","代码许可","The game-module repository declares GPLv2; individual files and separately acquired engine, launcher and tools need their own license checks.","codeLicense","开始使用",[125],"access",{"_58":126,"_25":103,"_127":128},"Free Steam game","note","Free Steam game. Engine, launcher, game modules, maps and other data are separate parts of th